  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.OptimismOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Optimism -- the OP Stack L2 powering the Ethereum Superchain, with EVM equivalence and cheap transactions. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on OP Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add native Optimism public balance CQL demo with conformance tests (b8855fc)\n- Fix Optimism V2 query authority and encryption chain identity (4df9768)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.OptimismOASIS",
